I’ve recently become intersted in learning Japanese since I’ve grown closer to my friend {FriendName}
She was born in Japan despite her parents being foreigners.
I met her in high school a few years ago when she moved away from home into the US,
But it wasn’t until college that I decided to learn more japanese.
Having been a few years away from home, my friend wanted to go back to Japan with an exchange program
And she invited me to tag along, which I thought was a great idea!
[wait time="1.0" hide_text="false" skippable="true"]
narrator: but {FriendName} has talked to them about me a couple of times and I’ve talked with them through video chat before, so we’re good friends.
[wait time="1.0" skippable="true"]
narrator: Just as we entered college, my friend saw there was a fashion club which she immediately joined.
She’s been really into J-fashion ever since I met her, it’s almost like her trademark.
